WEBVTT

00:01:49.266 --> 00:01:50.266
They've come...

00:01:50.866 --> 00:01:54.866
Comrades!
We are now about to go into battle!

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:58.966
This is an all-out war!
I'm counting on your efforts!

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:19.100
With the knowledge from translated
portions of the Extra Seven,

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:21.333
we have developed
the Power Booster!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:32.670
What is it?!

00:02:32.966 --> 00:02:33.966
This is...

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.100
What's this, maro?!
They've suddenly become stronger, maro!

00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:51.326
It's the enemy's new weapon.

00:02:51.966 --> 00:02:54.896
We should assume they're
completely different from before!

00:03:10.633 --> 00:03:12.033
W-What's this?!

00:03:13.266 --> 00:03:14.496
Marvelous, isn't it?

00:03:14.733 --> 00:03:19.203
This is your final resting place,
the Ice Coliseum!

00:03:24.933 --> 00:03:26.273
Eternal Breath!

00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:27.966
Fire Crisis!

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:38.496
Ouch...

00:03:38.766 --> 00:03:40.326
Oww...

00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:43.533
Where were you looking?!

00:03:44.566 --> 00:03:49.096
I'll take good care of everyone,
especially you...

00:03:52.666 --> 00:03:57.566
CYNTHIA'S MADNESS

00:04:06.366 --> 00:04:08.996
They're strong, maro.
It's not fair, maro.

00:04:09.133 --> 00:04:10.133
Awesome!

00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:13.526
As long as we have this medallion,
this Power Booster...

00:04:13.866 --> 00:04:14.866
We could win!

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.200
The situation doesn't look good for us.

00:04:30.633 --> 00:04:32.273
Zola, what are we going to do, maro?

00:04:32.933 --> 00:04:33.933
Let's see...

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.730
We will hold this front as is!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.670
Maro?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.470
That's what I want to say, but for now,
we should think of a way to not get beaten.

00:04:49.466 --> 00:04:52.326
Marumaro! Try not to stay in
one place as much as possible.

00:04:52.966 --> 00:04:54.266
I want to check out something.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.600
Maro?

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:56.700
I'm counting on you.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.970
What, maro?!
I don't understand, maro!

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:02.166
Let's listen to her, Marumaro.

00:05:02.433 --> 00:05:03.103
Maro?

00:05:03.666 --> 00:05:07.396
I'm sure she will find us
a way out of this.

00:05:08.233 --> 00:05:08.903
Maro...

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.200
Now, let me have some fun!

00:05:40.966 --> 00:05:41.626
Bouquet!

00:05:43.966 --> 00:05:45.666
Kluke, take care of Bouquet!

00:05:45.766 --> 00:05:46.426
Got it!

00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:51.973
Sheesh, what are you all doing?
There's only one of them.

00:05:52.166 --> 00:05:54.596
It's the same opponent,
but she is different from before!

00:05:54.933 --> 00:05:56.573
Her power and speed
are incomparable.

00:06:02.233 --> 00:06:03.233
Hey, hey.

00:06:04.333 --> 00:06:06.503
That's not what I want to know.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:07.870
Then what is it?

00:06:09.266 --> 00:06:11.826
I'm asking if you are
going to remain silent.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.900
You don't need to ask.

00:06:17.566 --> 00:06:19.496
I don't plan to remain silent.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.170
Roger that.

00:06:21.466 --> 00:06:22.766
Where are you looking at?

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.900
You're going to die if you
don't pay attention!

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.600
We're winning up to this point.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.230
Yeah, up to this point.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:51.730
The outcome of this battle will
decide the path I must take.

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:55.273
Thousand Streams Strike!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:10.870
What's wrong?
You don't look so good, boy!

00:07:17.266 --> 00:07:19.426
Don't get full of yourself!

00:07:19.466 --> 00:07:22.996
I'm telling you!
We're in a different level!

00:07:23.033 --> 00:07:24.373
A different level!

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:26.600
- Shu!
- Shu!

00:07:29.733 --> 00:07:31.673
It doesn't matter.

00:07:32.066 --> 00:07:34.866
I'm never going to lose
to someone like you!

00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:38.403
Someone who fights just for fun!

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:43.230
I can't allow the sadness
to spread any further!

00:07:58.266 --> 00:07:58.926
That's right.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.000
I can't be stalling at a place like this.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.170
No matter what, I will defeat Nene!

00:08:10.333 --> 00:08:12.133
You've got a good expression
on your face.

00:08:12.866 --> 00:08:15.196
Shu! Everyone!
Keep pressing the attack!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.300
And we will win!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.170
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:08:25.033 --> 00:08:26.103
What's so funny?!

00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:28.633
Stop fooling around.

00:08:29.633 --> 00:08:32.133
You think will power is enough

00:08:32.166 --> 00:08:35.826
to make up for the overwhelming
difference in our strengths?!

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:43.970
There!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.400
Ray Stinger!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.500
There!

00:08:57.566 --> 00:08:59.066
Feather Storm!

00:09:06.133 --> 00:09:07.173
Maro...

00:09:07.433 --> 00:09:10.333
Our situation isn't changing.
At this rate...

00:09:12.266 --> 00:09:13.796
No, that's not entirely true.

00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:14.503
Maro?

00:09:15.166 --> 00:09:17.426
Then, have you found
a way to defeat them?

00:09:18.066 --> 00:09:21.826
There is no guarantee.
But the situation will change eventually.

00:09:22.033 --> 00:09:23.033
Maro?

00:09:23.533 --> 00:09:26.273
Until then, why don't we
try an aerial battle?

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:28.003
Maro?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.630
General Logi, the supplies
have all been loaded.

00:09:44.133 --> 00:09:45.373
We'll be taking off.

00:09:45.433 --> 00:09:47.333
No, we're going to stand by.

00:09:47.966 --> 00:09:48.966
What do you mean?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.170
I have what they want on this ship.

00:09:52.533 --> 00:09:56.103
Don't you think it's cruel
to take it away from them?

00:09:56.666 --> 00:09:59.066
In other words, we are the bait.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.830
The Extra Seven...

00:10:03.733 --> 00:10:04.733
However...

00:10:06.066 --> 00:10:10.066
Our forces are much stronger,
and yet we are unable to finish them off.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.900
I wonder why?

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.200
Perhaps the enemy has become
more proficient in battle over time.

00:10:16.166 --> 00:10:18.396
I don't think that's all...

00:10:25.866 --> 00:10:27.626
Feather Protect!

00:10:41.866 --> 00:10:42.526
No way!

00:10:42.733 --> 00:10:43.733
The shield!

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.530
First, this girl!

00:10:49.366 --> 00:10:50.366
Next!

00:10:54.533 --> 00:10:56.003
You!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.300
Oh, is that all the power you have?

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.100
Don't take me so lightly!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:18.030
Yup, yup, that's it.
But you still have a lot to do to satisfy me.

00:11:18.366 --> 00:11:19.726
But, you know, old lady...

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.770
Who's an old lady?! Who?!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.000
Your opponent is not just me.

00:11:26.233 --> 00:11:27.873
Crushing Nail!

00:11:31.966 --> 00:11:32.626
What?!

00:11:33.166 --> 00:11:35.266
I know that.

00:11:42.566 --> 00:11:48.966
But the only one
I'm interested in is you.

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.500
It seems the battle is still continuing.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.500
Yeah, and it seems like there aren't
any casualties on either side yet.

00:12:18.433 --> 00:12:22.573
We are still at an advantage
in the overall war though.

00:12:22.766 --> 00:12:26.866
But I don't like how they're
going to take all the credit.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:30.000
Battles can be found anywhere.

00:12:30.766 --> 00:12:36.266
After this battle is over, we'll have another
battlefield prepared for us, I suppose.

00:12:44.533 --> 00:12:45.973
Miss Zola.

00:12:46.933 --> 00:12:48.733
If possible,
I want to face you once more...

00:12:55.466 --> 00:12:57.266
Okay, as we planned, got it?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.170
Maro!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:12:59.370
Maro?!

00:13:06.866 --> 00:13:08.666
It seems like they can't do anything.

00:13:09.233 --> 00:13:12.703
Yeah, it seems running around
is all they can do.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.470
Still, they are persistent.

00:13:21.566 --> 00:13:22.966
Ray stinger!

00:13:27.633 --> 00:13:28.633
Useless!

00:13:28.833 --> 00:13:29.833
Really?

00:13:31.866 --> 00:13:32.526
What?

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:33.570
Bishop!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.430
Maro!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:39.600
We fight for justice! Take this!
This mighty attack!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:43.470
Deadly blow!
Jumping, Camping, Shopping!

00:13:57.233 --> 00:13:58.503
We did it, maro!

00:13:58.933 --> 00:13:59.603
Yes.

00:13:59.933 --> 00:14:03.273
By the way, that attack
is called Sonic Scissors.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.600
Oh?

00:14:04.633 --> 00:14:06.133
Bishop!

00:14:06.166 --> 00:14:07.326
How dare you!

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:19.970
We were tricked!

00:14:20.033 --> 00:14:24.603
She was going for this from the beginning,
making the attacks so she could corner us!

00:14:24.833 --> 00:14:27.833
Zola sure is a force
to be reckoned with.

00:14:28.433 --> 00:14:29.103
Captain!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.200
I know!
I won't let it end like this!

00:14:37.766 --> 00:14:38.426
This is?

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.900
Finally.

00:14:47.333 --> 00:14:48.903
No response from Bishop.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.070
What?

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:54.470
Gilliam's entire squadron is losing power!
Their brain waves are erratic!

00:14:55.233 --> 00:14:55.903
What is?

00:14:56.433 --> 00:14:58.533
It was faster than I thought.

00:14:59.233 --> 00:15:00.533
What do you mean?

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.830
It seems like they have
reached their limits.

00:15:03.366 --> 00:15:04.026
Their limits?

00:15:04.533 --> 00:15:07.073
The medallion is still in
the middle of development.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.800
Problems like this one
are to be expected.

00:15:10.933 --> 00:15:11.603
But...

00:15:12.266 --> 00:15:13.696
Think about it.

00:15:14.166 --> 00:15:17.466
One section of the Extra Seven
was deciphered,

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.830
but a large part of it
still remains a mystery.

00:15:20.166 --> 00:15:22.696
According to the battle data
we've collected so far,

00:15:22.733 --> 00:15:25.303
we know that the Shadow's
physical power in battle

00:15:25.333 --> 00:15:27.433
has to do with the Wielder's
mental strength.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.000
But that's all we know.

00:15:29.933 --> 00:15:31.173
That's all...

00:15:31.933 --> 00:15:36.903
The Shadow is shrouded in mystery
more than we think.

00:15:36.933 --> 00:15:39.973
An existence that is largely unknown
for the most part.

00:15:45.466 --> 00:15:48.866
You are forcefully squeezing out
more power than you are capable of.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.570
Naturally, you will
suffer the consequences.

00:15:52.166 --> 00:15:53.226
Just as I thought!

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.500
Order Gilliam and Cynthia to withdraw!

00:15:55.933 --> 00:15:58.573
Tell them to leave the rest
up to the second line of defense!

00:15:58.933 --> 00:15:59.603
Roger!

00:16:10.033 --> 00:16:11.273
It gives me the chills.

00:16:11.733 --> 00:16:15.873
It gives me the chills!
Your scar and your expression!

00:16:16.033 --> 00:16:19.973
More! Let me feel it more!
Let me feel your pain!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.500
To me! More!

00:16:25.766 --> 00:16:27.566
You perverted woman...

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:31.870
What?!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:36.500
We're withdrawing?!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.200
Are you kidding me? I'm stillâ€”!

00:16:43.066 --> 00:16:44.066
What?

00:16:45.233 --> 00:16:46.833
What is this?!

00:16:47.966 --> 00:16:50.496
Ow! Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.500
Jiro, I'm not sure, but...

00:16:56.966 --> 00:16:59.866
Yeah... It looks like
the tables have turned.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:12.800
Don't kid around!
We can't just withdraw like this!

00:17:13.066 --> 00:17:14.166
Wait, Todd!

00:17:20.033 --> 00:17:21.803
Where is that brat?!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.130
Maro!

00:17:30.166 --> 00:17:31.166
There!

00:17:32.666 --> 00:17:33.866
You're mine!

00:17:34.233 --> 00:17:35.803
That's my line.

00:17:41.566 --> 00:17:42.596
Shoot!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.500
Now he's the decoy?

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.930
Hornet Assassin!

00:18:01.833 --> 00:18:03.333
At least that's over.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.600
What happened?

00:18:12.766 --> 00:18:16.166
Where did your attitude go,
old lady?

00:18:18.566 --> 00:18:20.126
It seems like you have
reached your limits.

00:18:22.166 --> 00:18:24.366
Then why don't you just
turn tail and run?

00:18:24.866 --> 00:18:25.866
Like always.

00:18:30.833 --> 00:18:31.903
Don't...

00:18:32.966 --> 00:18:36.726
Don't mess with me, you brat!
Who said I'm gonna leave?!

00:18:36.833 --> 00:18:38.773
Who do you think I am?!

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:42.700
Limits?!
I don't have limits!

00:18:42.866 --> 00:18:46.066
I'm gonna beat all of you!

00:18:58.933 --> 00:18:59.933
That's...

00:19:00.366 --> 00:19:02.726
A woman's obsession...
Scary.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.100
But, I think I kinda understand.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:17.400
You better not regret, damn it!
Impact Overdrive!

00:19:22.066 --> 00:19:24.426
Idiot, that attack isn't gonna...

00:19:27.933 --> 00:19:28.933
Man!

00:19:48.433 --> 00:19:51.003
She still has that much power?

00:19:51.033 --> 00:19:52.133
No, wait...

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.870
What's going on?

00:20:00.333 --> 00:20:01.403
She's going out of control.

00:20:01.833 --> 00:20:02.833
Out of control?

00:20:02.933 --> 00:20:07.003
She was using powers
beyond her limits this entire battle,

00:20:07.033 --> 00:20:10.433
and now she's pushed them
even further.

00:20:16.466 --> 00:20:17.896
That's the result of it.

00:20:24.733 --> 00:20:25.933
Hey boy...

00:20:26.933 --> 00:20:27.933
Boy...

00:20:28.433 --> 00:20:29.733
Let's go...

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:42.970
Let's go together with me!

00:20:47.233 --> 00:20:48.703
Never gonna happen.

00:20:50.033 --> 00:20:51.033
Waves of Rage!

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.330
It seems like they did it.

00:21:23.166 --> 00:21:24.366
Maro.

00:21:30.366 --> 00:21:32.696
Lost connection with
Cynthia and Yarovit.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.270
The first line of defense
has been breached.

00:21:35.733 --> 00:21:36.733
Idiots.

00:21:36.866 --> 00:21:39.096
It's because they ignored
General Logi's orders.

00:21:39.466 --> 00:21:42.526
Don't say that.
They fought courageously.

00:21:42.966 --> 00:21:45.366
They didn't give up
their pride till the end.

00:21:45.733 --> 00:21:46.403
Yes...

00:21:48.166 --> 00:21:50.926
Contact Schneider,
Lemaire, and Andropov.

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:53.870
Tell them to never let the enemy
breach the second line of defense.

00:21:54.233 --> 00:21:54.903
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:21:56.933 --> 00:21:57.933
And...

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:01.900
Join forces and face them
in direct battle?!

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:03.500
What does that mean?

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:04.900
Who knows?

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:07.430
It seems like it's
General Logi's direct order.

00:22:07.966 --> 00:22:10.126
It seems like he has a plan.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:12.830
Oh well.

00:22:13.366 --> 00:22:16.466
I was getting bored
with just sniping, anyway.

00:22:19.333 --> 00:22:20.973
It's a chance at revenge.

00:22:22.933 --> 00:22:24.233
Miss Zola...

00:22:32.866 --> 00:22:35.066
The enemy has breached
the first line of defense.

00:22:35.400 --> 00:22:38.030
They are advancing toward
the second line of defense.

00:22:38.466 --> 00:22:39.466
I repeat...

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:40.170
The enemy...

00:22:40.466 --> 00:22:45.296
The battle has just begun.
Show me what you can do...

00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:24.070
Lemaire shows extreme
attachment to Zola.

00:24:24.333 --> 00:24:26.233
The truth is finally revealed.

00:24:26.266 --> 00:24:29.026
Look, he's copying Zola's hair style
and even the cloth belt...

00:24:29.066 --> 00:24:31.266
That's the look of a guy in love
trying to draw the attention.

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:35.830
Wait, hold on a minute here.
Who came? Huh? Logi?

00:24:36.100 --> 00:24:38.700
Next on Blue Dragon:
Into Logi's Ship
